Creating Active Directory Environment
Objective
To build a Windows Server Active Directory environment capable of managing users, departments, and permissions in a simulated business environment.



Step 1 - Install Oracle VirtualBox
Installed Oracle VirtualBox to host virtual machines.

________________________________________________

Step 2 - Create Windows Server Virtual Machine
Created a virtual machine named:

DC02

Configuration:

4 GB RAM
2 Virtual CPUs
60 GB Storage

________________________________________________

Step 3 - Install Windows Server 2025
Installed:

Windows Server 2025 Standard Evaluation (Desktop Experience)

________________________________________________

Step 4 - Configure Active Directory Domain Services
Installed the Active Directory Domain Services role using Server Manager.

Role installed:

Active Directory Domain Services
Supporting services:

_______________________________________________

DNS Server
